@eduardopeynetti <https://www.kaggle.com/eduardopeynetti>, to learn more about why PCA does not work with noisy financial data I recommend checking out "Statistical consequences of fat tails" by Nassim Taleb. t-SNE can model a lot more non-linearity compared to PCA.
